  m_Name: Question 7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  questionText: 7. Like lenses, we can define the focus for a prism.
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: In a prism, parallel rays after refraction from the prism will
    not meet at one place and hence the focus cannot be defined for a prism.
